Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Locusts Unmoor the Hull
- Story & Context: During an unseasonal swarm of marsh cicadas over the grain terminal at Pier 42, Kaelen Vane struck her lowest marimba bars against the blaring blast of a blind-running Liberian freighter. The ship answered her rhythmic tapping with a deafening two-tone blast that shook diesel silt into her eyes, snapping her primary mallet in half against the timber keys. She continued singing into the vapor to calm the panicked dock workers: "Every drowned carapace learns to blow the horn." That collision of insect hum, splintered wood, and pressurized steel established the genre's first true maritime communion.
